note One sibling box: the children of one parent on one side, all in the same lane. The box's top is level with the parent, less pad_cross, unless the lane is already used past that point, in which case it starts where the lane is free; the members then follow each other sibling_gap apart. The box is recorded in Built.siblings so the scene can draw it and the arrow keys can find siblings.

