symbol place_nodes
lines 0 38
hash 86bc5170bdadee53
note The one entry, called from App::graph_layout after Built::measure has written every size. It groups the nodes by rank, clears last frame's sibling boxes, lays out the lanes along the main axis, builds the forest, then for each root in step order: places it at the start of a band below everything placed so far (the furthest free cross position of any lane), and walks breadth first from it, each node's callee-side children and then its caller-side children that are not placed yet becoming one sibling box beside it (place_siblings). The done set places a node reachable from two parents only once, under the first. It writes one CellPoint per node into position and one Siblings per box into siblings.

